<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - St Helena Q2 distrib income jumps.</title>
<headline>TABLE - St Helena Q2 distrib income jumps.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distrib income			   14.91 vs 5.75</p>
<p>    Capital recoupment			2.64 vs 1.67 spending</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 1,706 vs 1,475</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		266,000 vs 230,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     6.4 vs 6.4</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  40,159 vs 44,527</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     49,130 vs 50,674</p>
<p>Full name: St Helena Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Gengold Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
